WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.300
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.570 --> 01:38.950
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.240 --> 01:41.820
[Episode 35]

4
01:42.030 --> 01:43.950
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

5
01:42.539 --> 01:44.000
Chu Wenfu has 3 regiments,

6
01:44.289 --> 01:45.479
about 5,000 men.

7
01:45.740 --> 01:46.539
Xiaoxian,

8
01:46.780 --> 01:49.200
the Third Regiment of the Third Army under your command,

9
01:49.200 --> 01:50.140
and Bingwen,

10
01:50.280 --> 01:52.430
the Fifth Regiment of the Seventh Army under your command—

11
01:52.430 --> 01:54.430
they must converge immediately...

12
01:55.680 --> 01:57.039
and drive them back.

13
01:57.420 --> 01:58.080
-Yes! -Yes!

14
01:58.570 --> 02:00.670
When will our artillery arrive?

15
02:00.690 --> 02:02.090
In 3 days at the earliest.

16
02:02.330 --> 02:02.970
3 days?

17
02:03.780 --> 02:04.700
We can hold out.

18
02:04.740 --> 02:06.200
I'll tell them to speed up.

19
02:15.690 --> 02:17.200
So you finally came back.

20
02:18.130 --> 02:20.320
Nanping is almost flattened!

21
02:20.620 --> 02:21.470
Where did you,

22
02:21.470 --> 02:22.720
the deputy commander-in-chief, go?

23
02:22.720 --> 02:23.720
What a disgrace!

24
02:24.430 --> 02:25.090
Changxuan.

25
02:25.650 --> 02:26.360
Chu Wenfu has launched

26
02:26.360 --> 02:27.460
a sudden, massive assault

27
02:27.460 --> 02:28.280
on Nanping,

28
02:28.690 --> 02:29.940
one of our territories.

29
02:29.940 --> 02:31.750
The casualties there are staggering.

30
02:31.750 --> 02:34.310
Over 1,000 civilians have been killed or wounded.

31
02:34.310 --> 02:35.970
The battalion stationed there

32
02:35.970 --> 02:38.079
has been virtually wiped out.

33
02:39.280 --> 02:41.130
Staff Officer Yang, who served under Marshal Xu,

34
02:41.130 --> 02:43.780
opposed the central government's assault on Nanping.

35
02:43.780 --> 02:45.980
He was executed on charges of colluding

36
02:47.970 --> 02:49.030
with rebel forces.

37
02:50.900 --> 02:51.740
Staff Officer Yang...

38
02:51.740 --> 02:52.670
He was executed!

39
02:53.910 --> 02:55.240
The central government

40
02:55.680 --> 02:56.460
has officially

41
02:56.460 --> 02:58.190
declared us rebels!

42
03:14.840 --> 03:16.040
Those bastards!

43
03:21.650 --> 03:23.510
Staff Officer Yang was my friend.

44
03:24.700 --> 03:26.270
He helped me many times.

45
03:26.750 --> 03:27.530
And the people

46
03:27.530 --> 03:28.300
and soldiers of Nanhuai

47
03:28.300 --> 03:29.490
mustn't die in vain!

48
03:29.810 --> 03:32.240
I never wanted to fight our own people.

49
03:33.900 --> 03:35.410
But now that the central government and Chu Wenfu

50
03:35.410 --> 03:36.810
have drawn their swords,

51
03:37.810 --> 03:39.510
this battle is unavoidable.

52
03:49.180 --> 03:49.810
Father,

53
03:51.960 --> 03:54.620
I request permission to lead the troops myself.

54
04:04.130 --> 04:05.240
Fifth Young Master,

55
04:05.240 --> 04:06.500
given our current situation,

56
04:06.500 --> 04:07.060
are you really going to

57
04:07.060 --> 04:08.520
take on Chu Wenfu head-on?

58
04:09.020 --> 04:10.020
Of course not.

59
04:10.870 --> 04:13.070
Do you have another plan up your sleeve?

60
04:18.740 --> 04:20.810
Chu Wenfu seems to have a formidable force,

61
04:20.810 --> 04:22.250
but his more than 10,000 troops

62
04:22.250 --> 04:23.370
are made up of his own men

63
04:23.370 --> 04:25.370
and hastily assembled central government forces.

64
04:25.370 --> 04:27.720
They don't share a unified command, and their troops lack cohesion.

65
04:27.720 --> 04:29.420
He's in a hurry to claim victory

66
04:29.420 --> 04:31.300
and establish his authority.

67
04:31.830 --> 04:34.500
That's his biggest weakness.

68
04:36.310 --> 04:38.690
Chu Wenfu is riding high right now.

69
04:38.720 --> 04:41.330
We'll make ourselves appear weak.

70
04:48.130 --> 04:49.870
He will definitely order a pursuit.

71
04:49.870 --> 04:50.860
Once his pursuing troops are stretched

72
04:50.860 --> 04:52.120
into a long, thin line,

73
04:52.390 --> 04:54.330
with the vanguard and rear unable to support each other,

74
04:54.330 --> 04:56.390
we'll have our chance to strike back.

75
05:00.690 --> 05:01.270
Fire!

76
05:12.610 --> 05:13.510
When the time comes,

77
05:13.510 --> 05:15.140
take a squad around behind enemy lines

78
05:15.140 --> 05:16.540
and burn their supplies.

79
05:16.590 --> 05:17.620
Once chaos breaks out in their rear,

80
05:17.620 --> 05:20.020
their troops at the front will lose morale.

81
05:21.600 --> 05:22.190
Ready.

82
05:25.950 --> 05:26.450
Throw!

83
05:33.800 --> 05:34.860
Charge!

84
05:39.390 --> 05:40.420
[Chu]

85
05:42.750 --> 05:43.550
Military Governor.

86
05:43.550 --> 05:44.190
We...

87
05:44.630 --> 05:46.800
We've fallen into Yu Changxuan's trap.

88
05:46.800 --> 05:48.200
He used a small squad as bait

89
05:48.200 --> 05:49.659
to lure us into the valley.

90
05:49.800 --> 05:50.600
His main force

91
05:50.830 --> 05:51.659
had already laid an ambush

92
05:51.659 --> 05:52.620
on both sides.

93
05:53.060 --> 05:54.860
Our vanguard was cut off,

94
05:55.360 --> 05:56.590
and our supply train in the rear

95
05:56.590 --> 05:57.920
was attacked.

96
05:58.010 --> 06:00.260
Every last supply wagon was burned.

97
06:00.420 --> 06:01.360
Our men

98
06:01.490 --> 06:03.470
don't even have a bite to eat now.

99
06:35.540 --> 06:36.600
I didn't expect him

100
06:37.420 --> 06:39.560
to actually turn the tables.

101
06:40.140 --> 06:41.470
At the meeting that day,

102
06:41.620 --> 06:43.750
he clearly intended to launch a frontal assault.

103
06:43.750 --> 06:46.010
But he changed his plan at the last minute

104
06:46.330 --> 06:48.860
and caught the Chu Army completely off guard.

105
06:49.120 --> 06:49.800
Yu Changxuan

106
06:49.800 --> 06:51.920
is becoming harder and harder to read.

107
06:51.920 --> 06:52.850
At this rate,

108
06:53.040 --> 06:55.159
he might actually win this war.

109
06:55.530 --> 06:56.190
Commander,

110
06:56.800 --> 06:58.620
what's our next move?

111
07:01.860 --> 07:02.990
I'll go investigate

112
07:03.890 --> 07:06.300
his movements again over the next couple of days.

113
07:06.300 --> 07:07.420
Whatever it takes,

114
07:08.130 --> 07:09.010
we must find out

115
07:09.010 --> 07:10.340
what he's planning next

116
07:11.370 --> 07:12.530
and report back to Military Governor Chu.

117
07:12.530 --> 07:13.260
Who's there?

118
08:01.570 --> 08:02.630
Deputy Commander.

119
08:03.370 --> 08:04.570
Our men found the Brigade Commander's body

120
08:04.570 --> 08:06.100
at the foot of the cliff.

121
08:06.860 --> 08:08.040
There was heavy rain last night,

122
08:08.040 --> 08:10.130
and the Brigade Commander went to the communications office to decode a message.

123
08:10.130 --> 08:11.870
The roads were slippery in the rain,

124
08:11.870 --> 08:14.330
but we don't yet know exactly what happened.

125
08:15.310 --> 08:16.710
Brigade Commander Zhang

126
08:17.090 --> 08:19.570
served the Commander faithfully for half his life.

127
08:19.570 --> 08:20.770
He worked tirelessly

128
08:21.690 --> 08:23.490
and earned everyone's respect.

129
08:24.860 --> 08:27.170
It's tragic that such an accident has happened.

130
08:27.170 --> 08:27.690
This is something

131
08:27.690 --> 08:29.040
none of us wanted to see.

132
08:32.630 --> 08:35.360
I hope you can find the strength to bear this loss.

133
08:39.650 --> 08:41.110
Send someone immediately

134
08:41.240 --> 08:43.500
to bring Mr. Zhang's body back to Nanhuai

135
08:44.120 --> 08:45.250
for a proper burial.

136
08:45.530 --> 08:49.910
[Latest Situation Map of Nanping]

137
08:45.910 --> 08:46.720
Remember.

138
08:48.550 --> 08:51.080
Comfort Mrs. Zhang and help her through this.

139
08:51.130 --> 08:51.940
Yes.

140
09:01.000 --> 09:01.660
Changxuan.

141
09:03.220 --> 09:05.500
The situation on the front lines is still manageable.

142
09:05.500 --> 09:07.160
I'd like to go back for a while.

143
09:07.360 --> 09:08.170
As you know,

144
09:09.100 --> 09:11.430
Father's health hasn't been good lately.

145
09:12.320 --> 09:13.450
And about Mr. Zhang,

146
09:14.400 --> 09:15.170
I don't feel comfortable

147
09:15.170 --> 09:17.300
having someone else deliver the news.

148
09:17.770 --> 09:20.100
I'd rather go back and tell Father myself.

149
09:21.390 --> 09:23.130
Besides, Mr. Zhang's family

150
09:24.240 --> 09:26.100
will need some reassurance, too.

151
09:43.000 --> 09:43.600
Thank you.

152
09:43.840 --> 09:44.390
Bye.

153
09:46.890 --> 09:49.850
[Jiaqi Flower Shop]

154
09:58.860 --> 09:59.670
Jinxuan?

155
10:03.150 --> 10:03.960
Pingjun.

156
10:06.000 --> 10:07.330
What are you doing here?

157
10:07.530 --> 10:09.000
I finally get to see you.

158
10:12.820 --> 10:13.600
Pingjun.

159
10:14.580 --> 10:15.770
We've heard about

160
10:16.200 --> 10:17.620
the baby.

161
10:18.080 --> 10:20.580
Mother has been very worried about you.

162
10:22.960 --> 10:24.320
How is everyone at home?

163
10:25.690 --> 10:27.890
Mother and the rest of us are doing fine.

164
10:27.940 --> 10:29.630
It's just that Father's health

165
10:29.630 --> 10:30.980
has been getting worse.

166
10:31.890 --> 10:33.210
What's wrong with Father?

167
10:33.210 --> 10:35.290
I don't know what's come over him lately.

168
10:35.290 --> 10:36.620
He's been coughing constantly

169
10:36.620 --> 10:38.360
and suffering from terrible headaches.

170
10:38.360 --> 10:40.890
A couple of days ago, he even coughed up blood.

171
10:42.100 --> 10:44.100
How could this happen all of a sudden?

172
10:44.100 --> 10:44.910
I don't know.

173
10:45.480 --> 10:47.320
We've had so many doctors examine him,

174
10:47.320 --> 10:49.890
but none of them could figure out what's wrong.

175
10:49.890 --> 10:51.580
The medicine they've prescribed

176
10:51.580 --> 10:53.010
hasn't helped at all.

177
10:53.390 --> 10:56.120
His headaches are only getting worse.

178
10:57.600 --> 10:58.480
I remember my mother used to suffer from

179
10:58.480 --> 10:59.770
coughing and headaches quite often

180
10:59.770 --> 11:01.320
before she passed away.

181
11:01.770 --> 11:03.600
I once consulted an old physician.

182
11:03.600 --> 11:04.660
He had a folk remedy

183
11:04.720 --> 11:05.920
that worked wonders.

184
11:06.220 --> 11:08.980
Why don't you ask him to take a look at Father?

185
11:13.600 --> 11:14.390
Pingjun,

186
11:15.100 --> 11:18.050
I know you still care about us

187
11:19.510 --> 11:21.360
and you still see us as family.

188
11:23.600 --> 11:25.150
In such chaotic times,

189
11:25.510 --> 11:27.240
how could we not worry about you

190
11:27.510 --> 11:29.390
being out here all alone?

191
11:30.750 --> 11:32.130
Actually, I know

192
11:33.010 --> 11:34.890
that deep down, you trust Changxuan

193
11:34.890 --> 11:37.720
when it comes to what happened to your mother.

194
11:38.360 --> 11:39.740
It's just that some things

195
11:39.740 --> 11:40.960
are hard to come to terms with,

196
11:40.960 --> 11:41.980
and some hurdles

197
11:42.050 --> 11:43.480
take time to overcome.

198
11:49.410 --> 11:50.750
Come home with me first.

199
11:51.100 --> 11:52.720
It's not for any other reason.

200
11:52.720 --> 11:54.980
Just to put Mother's mind at ease.

201
11:55.510 --> 11:57.890
Now that Father's ill

202
11:58.510 --> 12:00.840
and Changxuan has gone to the front lines,

203
12:01.860 --> 12:03.940
Mother has been on edge every day.

204
12:04.840 --> 12:05.960
If you go back,

205
12:06.360 --> 12:08.290
she will definitely be very happy.

206
12:11.510 --> 12:13.530
Let's go find the physician together,

207
12:13.530 --> 12:16.260
get the medicine according to the prescription,

208
12:16.720 --> 12:18.580
and watch Father slowly recover.

209
12:19.130 --> 12:20.320
Just seeing you

210
12:21.120 --> 12:22.030
might make Father

211
12:22.030 --> 12:23.170
so happy

212
12:23.500 --> 12:24.150
that half his illness

213
12:24.150 --> 12:25.320
will disappear.

214
12:25.550 --> 12:28.150
That'll do him more good than any miracle cure.

215
12:30.220 --> 12:31.010
Pingjun,

216
12:31.510 --> 12:33.100
I'm begging you.

217
12:33.840 --> 12:36.840
Come home with me first, okay?

218
13:07.820 --> 13:08.600
Pingjun!

219
13:09.850 --> 13:10.600
-Mother. -Pingjun!

220
13:10.600 --> 13:11.130
Pingjun is back.

221
13:11.130 --> 13:12.010
You're really back?

222
13:12.010 --> 13:13.460
I'm not dreaming, am I?

223
13:13.740 --> 13:14.440
Pingjun.

224
13:14.580 --> 13:15.150
Mother.

225
13:17.240 --> 13:17.980
My child,

226
13:17.980 --> 13:19.780
You're finally back.

227
13:21.600 --> 13:24.170
Do you know how worried

228
13:24.220 --> 13:26.220
we've been since you left?

229
13:26.770 --> 13:27.890
In these chaotic times,

230
13:27.890 --> 13:29.100
you were all alone.

231
13:30.770 --> 13:31.720
Yes, Pingjun.

232
13:31.980 --> 13:32.620
We've all

233
13:32.620 --> 13:34.550
been thinking of you day and night.

234
13:34.720 --> 13:36.850
Mother, it's good that she's back now.

235
13:37.010 --> 13:37.860
Yes.

236
13:43.960 --> 13:44.580
Come on.

237
13:47.510 --> 13:48.000
Mother.

238
13:48.470 --> 13:49.830
I heard from Jinxuan

239
13:49.870 --> 13:51.200
that Father hasn't been well lately

240
13:51.200 --> 13:52.670
and has been suffering from terrible headaches.

241
13:52.670 --> 13:53.250
So I brought

242
13:53.250 --> 13:55.050
a folk remedy that my mother used to take.

243
13:55.050 --> 13:56.210
It worked wonders.

244
13:56.480 --> 13:58.390
I also want to do something for Father.

245
13:58.390 --> 13:59.700
Good girl.

246
14:00.460 --> 14:02.390
You still care about us.

247
14:02.720 --> 14:04.450
You still think of this family.

248
14:06.710 --> 14:08.070
That's wonderful.

249
14:10.370 --> 14:12.830
Before Changxuan left for the battlefield,

250
14:12.840 --> 14:15.620
you were the one he worried about most.

251
14:19.360 --> 14:20.500
Now it's good.

252
14:20.620 --> 14:21.750
Now that you're back,

253
14:21.750 --> 14:23.820
don't leave again.

254
14:24.130 --> 14:25.930
Let's all stay together

255
14:25.980 --> 14:28.180
and live happily as a family. All right?

256
14:28.510 --> 14:29.840
That's right, Pingjun.

257
14:30.100 --> 14:31.390
This is your home.

258
14:32.000 --> 14:33.930
Now that you're back, don't leave.

259
14:35.290 --> 14:36.100
Pingjun.

260
14:36.620 --> 14:38.480
In times like these,

261
14:38.480 --> 14:39.910
it's more important than ever

262
14:39.910 --> 14:41.410
for our family to stay together

263
14:41.410 --> 14:43.210
and face whatever comes our way.

264
14:54.430 --> 14:54.960
Alright.

265
14:57.290 --> 14:57.890
Good girl.

266
14:57.910 --> 14:58.770
Come, sit down.

267
14:59.670 --> 15:00.970
Jinxuan, you too. You too.

268
15:00.970 --> 15:02.830
Thank you for everything you did.

269
15:26.360 --> 15:28.030
Xiaoxian could be

270
15:29.080 --> 15:30.630
a bit of a bookworm.

271
15:31.460 --> 15:33.720
Some people call him a pedantic scholar,

272
15:33.980 --> 15:35.580
stubborn and set in his ways.

273
15:37.390 --> 15:39.520
But whenever we fought a tough battle,

274
15:40.750 --> 15:42.550
he was always on the front lines.

275
15:42.980 --> 15:44.440
Every Qingming Festival,

276
15:44.770 --> 15:46.250
he'd burn extra offerings

277
15:46.250 --> 15:48.250
for the brothers who died in battle.

278
15:49.120 --> 15:50.250
I once asked him why,

279
15:51.790 --> 15:52.720
and he said they

280
15:52.720 --> 15:54.320
had suffered enough in life,

281
15:55.790 --> 15:57.390
and that he couldn't let them

282
15:57.960 --> 16:00.560
go without proper offerings in the afterlife.

283
16:02.100 --> 16:02.820
Father,

284
16:04.080 --> 16:05.740
please don't grieve too much.

285
16:06.720 --> 16:07.920
Mr. Zhang's death...

286
16:09.890 --> 16:11.090
was just an accident.

287
16:12.500 --> 16:14.080
Back then at headquarters,

288
16:15.360 --> 16:17.220
a dozen men used to shout so loudly

289
16:18.030 --> 16:19.840
that we nearly raised the roof.

290
16:21.360 --> 16:22.460
Over the years,

291
16:23.270 --> 16:25.470
we've fought one battle after another,

292
16:26.500 --> 16:28.460
and one by one, they've fallen.

293
16:29.860 --> 16:30.770
And now,

294
16:33.250 --> 16:35.030
even Xiaoxian is gone.

295
16:37.750 --> 16:38.370
Father,

296
16:39.580 --> 16:41.440
you must take care of your health.

297
16:43.250 --> 16:44.310
Before I came back,

298
16:44.980 --> 16:46.840
Changxuan specifically asked me

299
16:47.270 --> 16:48.860
to help you recover

300
16:49.790 --> 16:51.850
and to tell you not to worry about him.

301
16:54.370 --> 16:54.840
Father,

302
16:55.150 --> 16:56.580
let me help you lie down and rest for a while.

303
16:56.580 --> 16:57.100
No.

304
16:59.120 --> 17:00.700
Leave me alone for a while.

305
17:59.850 --> 18:01.740
You're back from the front so soon?

306
18:01.740 --> 18:03.800
Looks like it's time to make our move.

307
18:03.940 --> 18:05.870
If you hadn't given your approval,

308
18:05.880 --> 18:06.850
my plan

309
18:07.570 --> 18:09.370
wouldn't have gone so smoothly.

310
18:17.810 --> 18:19.000
The parapet isn't packed tightly enough.

311
18:19.000 --> 18:19.640
It won't withstand

312
18:19.640 --> 18:21.010
heavy machine-gun fire.

313
18:21.010 --> 18:21.810
Reinforce it.

314
18:22.400 --> 18:22.810
Yes.

315
18:27.660 --> 18:29.530
And this drainage ditch isn't deep enough either.

316
18:29.530 --> 18:30.500
After another rain,

317
18:30.500 --> 18:31.900
it'll turn into a mud pit.

318
18:32.250 --> 18:33.050
Dig it deeper.

319
18:34.580 --> 18:36.110
I don't think these trenches

320
18:36.110 --> 18:37.770
need any more reinforcement.

321
18:40.480 --> 18:42.610
What are you doing? Starting a mutiny?

322
18:43.500 --> 18:44.830
Regiment Commander Lu,

323
18:45.700 --> 18:46.960
what do you mean by this?

324
18:46.960 --> 18:48.020
Deputy Commander,

325
18:48.720 --> 18:50.050
I have my reasons.

326
18:51.060 --> 18:52.360
I'm sorry.

327
18:56.460 --> 18:59.900
Pingjun, it's all thanks to your medicine.

328
19:00.770 --> 19:01.720
Look,

329
19:02.610 --> 19:06.010
your father has been looking much better these past two days.

330
19:07.250 --> 19:09.160
Father, the medicine is ready.

331
19:10.160 --> 19:11.490
Drink it while it's hot.

332
19:12.640 --> 19:13.530
Let me do it.

333
19:13.920 --> 19:15.580
You've been busy all morning.

334
19:16.090 --> 19:16.750
Commander!

335
19:18.330 --> 19:18.990
Commander!

336
19:20.070 --> 19:20.680
Madam.

337
19:21.680 --> 19:23.080
The Deputy Commander...

338
19:24.050 --> 19:25.650
What happened to Changxuan?

339
19:25.720 --> 19:26.250
He...

340
19:27.090 --> 19:28.950
He was inspecting the front lines

341
19:29.380 --> 19:31.090
when an explosion suddenly went off.

342
19:31.090 --> 19:33.350
We don't know whether he's alive or dead.

343
19:33.480 --> 19:34.310
Changxuan!

344
19:34.420 --> 19:34.830
Madam!

345
19:34.830 --> 19:35.890
-Mother! -Mother!

346
19:35.920 --> 19:38.050
-Mother, careful! -Mother, careful.

347
19:41.380 --> 19:42.380
Explain clearly.

348
19:43.050 --> 19:44.380
What exactly happened?

349
19:44.680 --> 19:46.330
Former men under Brigade Commander Zhang

350
19:46.330 --> 19:47.460
suddenly mutinied.

351
19:47.550 --> 19:48.010
They...

352
19:48.200 --> 19:49.440
They claimed the Deputy Commander

353
19:49.440 --> 19:51.300
killed Brigade Commander Zhang.

354
19:52.250 --> 19:52.920
Bingwen,

355
19:53.290 --> 19:55.030
call headquarters immediately

356
19:55.030 --> 19:56.590
and have the troops mobilized.

357
19:56.590 --> 19:57.750
I'll go there myself

358
19:58.180 --> 19:59.640
and bring Changxuan back.

359
20:00.570 --> 20:01.200
Hurry!

360
20:19.380 --> 20:20.180
What's wrong?

361
20:27.070 --> 20:27.720
Father.

362
20:28.250 --> 20:29.240
Death

363
20:29.240 --> 20:31.700
is part of war.

364
20:32.010 --> 20:34.090
Why make such a fuss?

365
20:34.200 --> 20:35.070
Bingwen,

366
20:35.500 --> 20:37.250
what are you talking about?

367
20:38.180 --> 20:39.750
You've always thought

368
20:40.660 --> 20:42.460
that soldiers' lives are cheap.

369
20:43.380 --> 20:45.090
So why should Yu Changxuan's life

370
20:45.090 --> 20:46.380
be any different?

371
20:47.960 --> 20:49.020
What are you doing?

372
20:49.570 --> 20:51.030
I'm staging a coup.

373
20:51.590 --> 20:52.700
Isn't it obvious?

374
20:55.000 --> 20:55.750
Father!

375
20:58.570 --> 20:58.850
Don't move!

376
20:58.850 --> 21:00.160
Wanqiao, hurry!

377
21:00.240 --> 21:00.790
Go get him...

378
21:00.790 --> 21:02.720
Go get him his heart pills.

379
21:04.330 --> 21:06.000
He's going to die anyway.

380
21:08.570 --> 21:10.030
Why waste medicine on him?

381
21:17.400 --> 21:18.220
Bingwen,

382
21:20.240 --> 21:21.830
this day has finally come.

383
21:23.870 --> 21:25.570
So you two...

384
21:26.440 --> 21:27.240
You two...

385
21:27.610 --> 21:28.590
Yu Zhongquan!

386
21:30.750 --> 21:31.510
Does the name

387
21:31.510 --> 21:33.290
Kuang Yuanshan ring a bell?

388
21:34.070 --> 21:34.900
No.

389
21:36.350 --> 21:38.180
20 years ago, in Heishan Forest,

390
21:39.030 --> 21:40.740
to save your elite troops,

391
21:42.000 --> 21:44.500
you ordered my father's company to stay behind

392
21:44.500 --> 21:46.160
and sent them to their deaths.

393
21:47.000 --> 21:47.790
His head...

394
21:49.590 --> 21:51.650
was cut off and put on public display.

395
21:51.900 --> 21:53.830
My mother was pregnant at the time.

396
21:54.000 --> 21:55.310
When she heard the news, she was so distraught

397
21:55.310 --> 21:56.330
that she rushed to the execution ground.

398
21:56.330 --> 21:57.010
And then...

399
21:58.380 --> 21:59.850
those bastards burned her alive

400
21:59.850 --> 22:01.680
along with my father!

401
22:02.050 --> 22:02.920
My sister and I

402
22:02.920 --> 22:04.270
witnessed it all.

403
22:04.990 --> 22:06.380
I'll never forget that scene

404
22:06.380 --> 22:08.090
for as long as I live.

405
22:10.090 --> 22:11.480
So all these years,

406
22:11.530 --> 22:13.390
you deliberately got close to me.

407
22:14.090 --> 22:15.810
You saved Changxuan's life

408
22:16.250 --> 22:18.460
and took such good care of Jinxuan.

409
22:20.050 --> 22:22.450
Was it all part of your carefully laid plan?

410
22:25.400 --> 22:26.590
I remember now.

411
22:27.740 --> 22:28.740
Kuang Yuanshan.

412
22:29.550 --> 22:31.900
He was the commander of the Vanguard Battalion.

413
22:31.900 --> 22:33.900
The interception at Heishan Forest

414
22:34.290 --> 22:35.720
was a military order!

415
22:36.140 --> 22:39.220
He remained unyielding after being captured.

416
22:39.220 --> 22:40.290
That made him a hero!

417
22:40.290 --> 22:42.480
You should be proud of him!

418
22:44.460 --> 22:45.380
Yu Zhongquan.

419
22:46.550 --> 22:47.570
Death is upon you,

420
22:47.570 --> 22:49.430
and you're still making excuses.

421
22:50.570 --> 22:51.660
You've been following me for so long.

422
22:51.660 --> 22:53.000
You should know

423
22:54.030 --> 22:56.030
that I don't bother to make excuses.

424
22:56.110 --> 22:57.840
It's okay if you don't admit it.

425
22:58.680 --> 23:01.510
I've been lying low in the Yu family for so many years

426
23:01.510 --> 23:03.590
just for this day.

427
23:05.830 --> 23:07.640
Now Gu Yigang listens to me.

428
23:08.150 --> 23:10.550
Zhang Xiaoxian's old subordinates also listen to me.

429
23:10.550 --> 23:11.310
Half of the entire Yu Army,

430
23:11.310 --> 23:12.440
plus my Seventh Army,

431
23:12.440 --> 23:13.290
are under

432
23:13.290 --> 23:15.010
my control!

433
23:18.010 --> 23:19.330
Your proudest son,

434
23:19.330 --> 23:20.960
Yu Mingxuan, is dead.

435
23:21.590 --> 23:22.700
Zhang Xiaoxian's old subordinates

436
23:22.700 --> 23:24.200
hate Yu Changxuan to the core.

437
23:24.200 --> 23:25.240
I guarantee he will

438
23:25.240 --> 23:26.610
die a miserable death!

439
23:27.680 --> 23:28.780
Yu Zhongquan,

440
23:29.500 --> 23:31.740
you'll be begging for death.

441
23:37.530 --> 23:38.440
Yu Zhongquan,

442
23:38.700 --> 23:40.250
I'll give you one chance.

443
23:40.850 --> 23:42.090
Sign this.

444
23:44.590 --> 23:46.250
Hand over the military power.

445
23:46.810 --> 23:49.930
[Yu Army Headquarters] [Transfer of Authority Document]

446
23:47.460 --> 23:48.270
I might just

447
23:48.270 --> 23:49.730
leave your corpse intact.

448
23:51.830 --> 23:53.400
What if I don't sign it?

449
23:59.790 --> 24:00.420
What are you doing?

450
24:00.420 --> 24:01.510
Let me go!

451
24:01.580 --> 24:01.960
Qixuan!

452
24:01.960 --> 24:02.490
Jinxuan.

453
24:02.700 --> 24:03.230
Jinxuan.

454
24:05.750 --> 24:07.290
I'll start with her.

455
24:08.440 --> 24:08.900
I'll make them

456
24:08.900 --> 24:10.500
join you in death, one by one!

457
24:13.050 --> 24:15.340
[Yu Army Headquarters] [Transfer of Authority Document]

458
24:26.920 --> 24:27.810
Kuang Bingwen.

459
24:29.570 --> 24:30.610
Stop making these

460
24:30.610 --> 24:32.050
high-sounding excuses.

461
24:33.010 --> 24:34.440
You know perfectly well that your parents' deaths

462
24:34.440 --> 24:36.500
had nothing to do with the Commander.

463
24:36.920 --> 24:37.510
You're just

464
24:37.510 --> 24:38.640
using them to justify

465
24:38.640 --> 24:39.810
your own ambition.

466
24:41.070 --> 24:42.070
Ye Pingjun.

467
24:42.850 --> 24:44.050
Fifth Young Madam.

468
24:44.720 --> 24:45.780
Come to think of it,

469
24:46.160 --> 24:47.820
you should actually thank me.

470
24:48.240 --> 24:49.790
If I hadn't spared your life back then,

471
24:49.790 --> 24:51.270
you'd have died with your mother

472
24:51.270 --> 24:52.960
in that little cabin.

473
24:55.640 --> 24:57.010
You were the one...

474
24:58.380 --> 24:59.720
who killed my mother?

475
25:03.960 --> 25:05.290
I was the one

476
25:05.880 --> 25:07.210
who ordered the fire.

477
25:08.980 --> 25:10.070
You were just a girl

478
25:10.070 --> 25:11.790
from a humble family.

479
25:12.220 --> 25:12.920
Given your background, your relationship

480
25:12.920 --> 25:14.220
with Yu Changxuan was acceptable.

481
25:14.220 --> 25:15.250
But then

482
25:15.420 --> 25:17.770
you turned out to be Tao Xili's daughter.

483
25:18.010 --> 25:20.140
How could Military Governor Chu, Commander Mu,

484
25:20.140 --> 25:20.810
and I possibly stand by

485
25:20.810 --> 25:22.290
and let Yu Changxuan

486
25:22.290 --> 25:23.690
gain such a powerful ally

487
25:23.790 --> 25:25.380
as the Tao family?

488
25:28.400 --> 25:30.920
I didn't expect you to survive that disaster!

489
25:30.920 --> 25:32.000
But too bad.

490
25:33.160 --> 25:35.270
Anyone connected to the Yu family

491
25:36.200 --> 25:37.830
is doomed today.

492
25:39.200 --> 25:39.980
Don't worry.

493
25:40.720 --> 25:42.030
I'll be merciful enough

494
25:42.030 --> 25:44.460
to let you die knowing the truth.

495
25:48.570 --> 25:51.180
Soon, you'll be in hell,

496
25:51.840 --> 25:52.950
reunited

497
25:53.980 --> 25:56.160
with your mother and your beloved

498
25:57.070 --> 25:57.980
Yu Changxuan.

499
26:14.270 --> 26:15.260
Changxuan?

500
26:15.680 --> 26:16.550
Changxuan!

501
26:16.810 --> 26:17.640
Changxuan?

502
26:17.700 --> 26:18.590
Changxuan?

503
26:20.240 --> 26:21.630
Yu Changxuan.

504
26:24.550 --> 26:25.480
I'm not dead yet.

505
26:26.140 --> 26:28.540
Sorry to disappoint you, Brother-in-law.

506
26:39.400 --> 26:40.550
Do you really think

507
26:40.700 --> 26:42.110
you can turn the tables with just

508
26:42.110 --> 26:43.570
these few men by your side?

509
26:44.640 --> 26:46.640
Almost the entire military command

510
26:46.640 --> 26:48.730
is already under my control.

511
26:49.790 --> 26:50.640
Is that so?

512
26:51.530 --> 26:52.790
-Don't move! -Freeze!

513
26:58.220 --> 26:59.140
Kuang Bingwen.

514
27:00.000 --> 27:01.250
Do you really think everything you've done

515
27:01.250 --> 27:02.500
is flawless?

516
27:03.010 --> 27:04.680
You probably never thought

517
27:05.500 --> 27:07.070
that Mr. Zhang would sacrifice his life

518
27:07.070 --> 27:08.470
to give me the final clue.

519
27:09.720 --> 27:10.850
Didn't you say

520
27:10.960 --> 27:12.350
Mr. Zhang's body would be taken

521
27:12.350 --> 27:12.940
back to Nanhuai tomorrow

522
27:12.940 --> 27:14.070
for a proper burial?

523
27:14.640 --> 27:15.160
Why did you call us over

524
27:15.160 --> 27:16.200
at this hour?

525
27:18.180 --> 27:20.380
Because I found something suspicious.

526
27:20.720 --> 27:22.630
The sand around Mr. Zhang's mouth

527
27:23.380 --> 27:24.200
is only found

528
27:24.200 --> 27:26.150
near our camp.

529
27:27.100 --> 27:29.090
But the cliff where he supposedly fell

530
27:29.090 --> 27:30.650
is covered in red soil.

531
27:31.200 --> 27:32.610
Are you saying

532
27:32.920 --> 27:34.010
Mr. Zhang's death

533
27:34.770 --> 27:35.900
wasn't an accident?

534
27:38.700 --> 27:39.720
Deputy Commander,

535
27:39.720 --> 27:41.290
apart from the fatal wound to the back of the Brigade Commander's head,

536
27:41.290 --> 27:41.810
there were

537
27:41.810 --> 27:43.050
other signs of a struggle on his body.

538
27:43.050 --> 27:43.530
Also,

539
27:43.850 --> 27:45.320
we found this

540
27:45.740 --> 27:47.000
deep inside his mouth.

541
27:47.240 --> 27:48.010
It looks like

542
27:48.220 --> 27:49.660
he swallowed it himself

543
27:49.660 --> 27:50.790
just before he died.

544
27:51.770 --> 27:53.010
Hatamen cigarettes?

545
27:54.060 --> 27:55.380
Only one man

546
27:55.400 --> 27:56.460
among the top brass

547
27:56.640 --> 27:57.700
smokes this brand.

548
27:57.960 --> 27:58.940
I'll take my men to arrest him right now!

549
27:58.940 --> 27:59.570
No!

550
28:00.920 --> 28:02.450
Hold your position for now.

551
28:03.090 --> 28:04.980
Most of the troops stationed near the camp

552
28:04.980 --> 28:06.880
belong to his Seventh Army.

553
28:08.070 --> 28:09.360
Arresting him now

554
28:09.570 --> 28:11.300
would surely trigger a mutiny.

555
28:11.480 --> 28:13.580
He volunteered to return to Nanhuai.

556
28:13.980 --> 28:15.680
He must have an ulterior motive.

557
28:15.680 --> 28:16.740
Deputy Commander,

558
28:16.920 --> 28:17.900
I'm sorry.

559
28:21.880 --> 28:22.850
How could you...

560
28:23.010 --> 28:23.550
You...

561
28:24.900 --> 28:25.570
I'll give you a chance

562
28:25.570 --> 28:27.220
to make amends.

563
28:28.330 --> 28:30.350
Report to Kuang Bingwen as planned

564
28:31.440 --> 28:32.160
that I

565
28:33.290 --> 28:34.510
was assassinated.

566
28:42.530 --> 28:45.070
Ruitong, what brings you here?

567
28:48.750 --> 28:49.480
Father,

568
28:50.940 --> 28:52.530
Fifth Young Master saw through

569
28:52.530 --> 28:54.660
your plan with Kuang Bingwen long ago.

570
28:55.680 --> 28:57.540
It's not too late to turn back now.

571
29:00.640 --> 29:01.830
Surrender.

572
29:04.480 --> 29:06.540
Whether you meant it or not back then,

573
29:08.400 --> 29:09.510
I owe you my life.

574
29:10.340 --> 29:11.850
Put your guns down!

575
29:12.270 --> 29:13.400
Lower your weapons!

576
29:18.310 --> 29:19.510
I accept defeat

577
29:21.550 --> 29:22.350
at your hands.

578
29:30.200 --> 29:31.060
Take them away.

579
29:34.330 --> 29:35.140
Changxuan.

580
29:40.320 --> 29:41.220
Let her go!

581
29:42.160 --> 29:43.010
Jinxuan!

582
29:43.040 --> 29:43.840
Let go of me!

583
29:44.740 --> 29:45.980
Nobody move!

584
29:46.000 --> 29:46.660
Jinxuan!

585
29:46.660 --> 29:47.990
-Jinxuan... -Jinxuan!

586
29:48.610 --> 29:49.340
Nobody move!

587
29:50.310 --> 29:51.480
Get out of my way!

588
29:52.000 --> 29:53.660
Be careful not to hurt Jinxuan.

589
29:53.660 --> 29:54.660
Get out of the way!

590
30:00.240 --> 30:00.920
Take one more step,

591
30:00.920 --> 30:02.520
and I'll shoot her right now!

592
30:06.770 --> 30:07.550
Mother!

593
30:08.460 --> 30:09.490
-Seventh Lady! -Mother!

594
30:09.490 --> 30:10.000
Mother!

595
30:10.000 --> 30:11.130
Where are you going?

596
30:11.480 --> 30:12.500
Mother!

597
30:13.900 --> 30:15.070
Mother!

598
30:15.270 --> 30:16.830
Don't leave me!

599
30:16.910 --> 30:18.600
Where are you going?

600
30:18.760 --> 30:20.180
-Mother! -My Lady!

601
30:20.390 --> 30:21.450
Mother!

602
30:21.690 --> 30:22.790
Mother!

603
30:23.350 --> 30:25.310
Mother, don't leave me!

604
30:26.110 --> 30:27.320
Mother!

605
30:27.840 --> 30:28.970
-Wanxuan! -Mother!

606
30:30.120 --> 30:31.460
I'm sorry!

607
30:31.480 --> 30:32.540
Mother!

608
30:33.000 --> 30:33.620
Mother!

609
30:33.650 --> 30:34.600
My Lady!

610
30:36.950 --> 30:37.950
Mother!

611
30:38.850 --> 30:40.370
Mother!

612
30:41.310 --> 30:42.750
Mother!

613
30:42.830 --> 30:44.140
Mother!

614
30:44.320 --> 30:46.120
Mother!

615
30:47.640 --> 30:49.040
Let me go, Kuang Bingwen!

616
30:49.660 --> 30:50.460
Let go!

617
30:52.000 --> 30:53.180
Let go of me!

618
30:54.730 --> 30:55.730
Get out of the car!

619
30:56.400 --> 30:57.120
Don't shoot!

620
30:57.120 --> 30:57.990
Kuang Bingwen!

621
30:58.700 --> 30:59.560
Kuang Bingwen!

622
31:21.980 --> 31:23.090
Careful!

623
31:26.670 --> 31:29.950
[Guangyi Gate]

624
31:34.860 --> 31:35.920
[Guangyi Gate]

625
31:53.490 --> 31:54.150
After them!

626
31:58.240 --> 31:58.900
Over there!

627
32:03.990 --> 32:04.640
Rickshaw!

628
32:07.640 --> 32:08.500
To the suburbs!

629
32:18.470 --> 32:19.360
Get out of the car!

630
32:19.360 --> 32:20.000
Get out!

631
32:21.980 --> 32:23.440
Let me go, Kuang Bingwen.

632
32:23.820 --> 32:25.830
Let me go! I said let me go!

633
32:34.350 --> 32:35.220
Kuang Bingwen!

634
32:36.270 --> 32:37.960
You can't go anywhere!

635
32:37.980 --> 32:39.800
They will be here soon!

636
32:39.830 --> 32:40.840
Let go of me!

637
32:41.590 --> 32:43.510
Kuang Bingwen, you can't escape!

638
32:43.770 --> 32:45.300
If I can't escape,

639
32:45.750 --> 32:47.280
we'll die here together.

640
32:47.770 --> 32:48.590
You're crazy!

641
32:48.770 --> 32:50.380
I've been crazy for a long time.

642
32:50.380 --> 32:51.550
Yu Jinxuan.

643
32:51.880 --> 32:53.030
We'll be together,

644
32:53.030 --> 32:54.160
in life and in death.

645
33:02.920 --> 33:03.830
Jinxuan!

646
33:03.850 --> 33:05.370
Go to hell!

647
33:43.960 --> 33:44.610
Jinxuan!

648
33:48.000 --> 33:48.740
Changxuan.

649
33:51.440 --> 33:52.160
Changxuan.

650
33:52.420 --> 33:53.330
Are you alright?

651
33:53.330 --> 33:53.910
I'm fine.

652
33:58.500 --> 33:59.240
Why?

653
34:01.420 --> 34:03.620
Why can't you let go of your obsession?

654
34:06.590 --> 34:07.650
What about you?

655
34:10.360 --> 34:10.960
Aren't...

656
34:12.500 --> 34:13.690
Aren't you the same?

657
34:17.179 --> 34:18.639
Do you think by doing this,

658
34:20.400 --> 34:22.290
Yu Jinxuan will be moved?

659
34:24.420 --> 34:26.350
Then what about my years of effort?

660
34:29.360 --> 34:30.420
What was it all for?

661
34:39.170 --> 34:40.320
Wanqiao.

662
34:44.960 --> 34:45.840
I owe you

663
34:48.550 --> 34:50.100
in this lifetime.

664
35:27.110 --> 35:28.270
Yu Jinxuan.

665
35:29.000 --> 35:29.800
Today,

666
35:31.400 --> 35:32.590
you've finally

667
35:32.670 --> 35:35.130
gotten what you wanted and broken free of me.

668
35:36.590 --> 35:37.670
Are you happy now?

669
35:40.550 --> 35:41.840
Listen.

670
35:42.520 --> 35:43.630
In our next life,

671
35:45.890 --> 35:47.090
I will definitely...

672
35:49.610 --> 35:51.070
not let you go.

673
36:16.190 --> 36:17.510
If only...

674
36:20.960 --> 36:22.260
I truly wish

675
36:24.550 --> 36:26.260
we'd never met

676
36:32.480 --> 36:34.280
at that field hospital.

677
38:02.840 --> 38:03.570
Bingwen,

678
38:05.440 --> 38:06.440
do you remember?

679
38:08.530 --> 38:11.260
When we were little, we went out to play together,

680
38:12.730 --> 38:13.590
and I sprained my ankle

681
38:13.590 --> 38:14.650
and couldn't walk.

682
38:15.260 --> 38:17.390
You carried me on your back all summer.

683
38:18.730 --> 38:20.300
That's when I decided

684
38:20.980 --> 38:22.070
I'd love only you

685
38:24.010 --> 38:25.610
for the rest of my life.

686
38:30.460 --> 38:31.210
Bingwen,

687
38:32.980 --> 38:34.050
in our next life...

688
38:37.570 --> 38:39.700
I don't want to be your sister anymore.

689
39:30.980 --> 39:32.070
Fourth Lady,

690
39:32.070 --> 39:33.780
is this handkerchief yours?

691
39:38.510 --> 39:40.800
This handkerchief has been lost for a long time.

692
39:40.800 --> 39:42.300
Where did you find it?

693
39:42.570 --> 39:43.360
I found it in Mr. Bingwen's

694
39:43.360 --> 39:44.800
inner pocket.

695
40:29.850 --> 40:30.590
Come on.

696
40:30.660 --> 40:31.480
Stop looking.

697
40:32.380 --> 40:33.710
Don't get your hopes up.

698
40:33.760 --> 40:34.460
She's

699
40:34.460 --> 40:36.130
the daughter of Commander-in-Chief Yu.

700
40:36.130 --> 40:36.820
Exactly.

701
40:36.820 --> 40:38.640
She's way out of your league.

702
40:49.780 --> 40:50.380
Father.

703
40:51.150 --> 40:52.950
Let me introduce you to Bingwen.

704
41:26.570 --> 41:27.940
Lilacs in Nanhuai's climate

705
41:27.940 --> 41:29.420
are hard to grow.

706
41:29.500 --> 41:32.150
I can't believe this one has buds.

707
41:34.900 --> 41:36.100
As long as you like it,

708
41:36.550 --> 41:37.880
no matter how hard it is,

709
41:37.980 --> 41:38.940
I will do it.

710
42:28.560 --> 42:29.610
I'm sorry.

711
42:34.980 --> 42:36.780
When two people love each other,

712
42:37.030 --> 42:38.840
they should trust each other.

713
42:41.380 --> 42:42.940
But I failed to do that.

714
42:54.900 --> 42:56.490
Don't blame yourself.

715
42:57.960 --> 43:01.150
You've been through more than enough.

716
43:02.170 --> 43:03.770
My brother-in-law's target

717
43:04.460 --> 43:06.570
was the Yu family.

718
43:10.210 --> 43:11.940
Never say sorry to me.

719
43:13.900 --> 43:14.780
It's me

720
43:16.460 --> 43:17.920
who failed to protect you.

721
43:26.760 --> 43:27.590
You said

722
43:28.440 --> 43:29.420
you wanted to do something

723
43:29.420 --> 43:30.860
more meaningful.

724
43:32.710 --> 43:33.550
I support you.

725
43:37.260 --> 43:38.050
Changxuan.

726
43:39.860 --> 43:42.260
I want to stay in the military camp with you,

727
43:42.260 --> 43:43.500
work as a nurse,

728
43:43.890 --> 43:45.250
and write war reports.

729
43:46.710 --> 43:48.860
I don't just want to stand behind you.

730
43:50.360 --> 43:52.010
I want to stand beside you.

731
43:56.580 --> 43:57.760
From now on,

732
43:58.630 --> 44:00.150
follow your heart

733
44:01.900 --> 44:03.300
and do what you want to do.

734
44:27.760 --> 44:29.020
Kuang Bingwen failed.

735
44:30.540 --> 44:32.140
I didn't expect Yu Changxuan

736
44:32.900 --> 44:34.960
to have kept something up his sleeve.

737
44:36.860 --> 44:37.890
Even so,

738
44:39.400 --> 44:41.190
it won't be easy for the Yu family

739
44:41.190 --> 44:42.450
to walk away unscathed

740
44:43.500 --> 44:45.700
from the confrontation with Chu Wenfu.

741
44:45.860 --> 44:47.170
That's true.

742
44:49.550 --> 44:50.610
Chu Wenfu is fiercely loyal

743
44:50.610 --> 44:52.140
to the central government.

744
44:52.960 --> 44:54.550
Until the very end,

745
44:55.510 --> 44:56.820
it's still

746
44:57.730 --> 44:59.090
anyone's game.

747
44:59.780 --> 45:02.670
Commander Mu, you certainly have the foresight

748
45:05.010 --> 45:06.440
to plan ahead

749
45:07.110 --> 45:08.570
and nip trouble in the bud.

750
45:14.260 --> 45:16.610
Now, the Japanese are pulling the strings,

751
45:16.610 --> 45:17.530
and the Tang family

752
45:17.530 --> 45:18.990
has been brought on board.

753
45:19.670 --> 45:20.800
Your appointment as a

754
45:20.800 --> 45:23.400
Legislative Council member in the Southern Government

755
45:23.400 --> 45:24.480
is a shrewd move.

756
45:25.030 --> 45:27.090
Legislators may not command troops,

757
45:27.110 --> 45:28.570
but they can set the rules.

758
45:28.790 --> 45:30.090
Sometimes,

759
45:31.920 --> 45:34.780
a single piece of legislation can outweigh an army.

760
45:34.780 --> 45:35.730
Then let's see

761
45:37.630 --> 45:38.710
if I'll get the chance

762
45:38.710 --> 45:40.770
to make Yu Changxuan play by my rules.

763
45:46.840 --> 45:48.680
Newspapers! Newspapers!

764
45:48.800 --> 45:50.690
Newspapers! Newspapers!

765
45:50.690 --> 45:53.980
Stop the civil war! Unite against foreign aggression!

766
45:51.820 --> 45:54.340
[No More Infighting! Stand Together!]

767
45:54.340 --> 45:55.590
[Civil War Ruins A Nation; Peace Builds A Nation]

768
45:54.650 --> 45:58.300
Civil war ruins a nation; peace builds a nation!

769
45:55.620 --> 45:58.770
[Da Feng Bank]

770
45:58.590 --> 46:02.230
Stop the civil war! Unite against foreign aggression!

771
46:01.460 --> 46:04.530
[Da Feng Bank]

772
46:02.370 --> 46:04.350
Civil war ruins a nation!

773
46:26.380 --> 46:28.460
[Nanping]

774
46:30.370 --> 46:31.400
Deputy Commander,

775
46:31.400 --> 46:33.000
the combined Chu-Mu allied forces are attacking us

776
46:33.000 --> 46:34.420
from both sides with 20,000 troops.

777
46:34.420 --> 46:36.300
Several sections of our defensive lines are now under severe pressure.

778
46:36.300 --> 46:39.150
Our casualties are... mounting.

779
46:39.480 --> 46:40.360
The central government keeps supplying them

780
46:40.360 --> 46:41.980
with ammunition and military funds.

781
46:41.980 --> 46:43.900
There is a huge disparity in strength between us.

782
46:43.900 --> 46:45.150
The current standoff

783
46:45.260 --> 46:46.480
is merely buying us some time.

784
46:46.480 --> 46:47.940
We want to fight the enemy,

785
46:48.030 --> 46:50.940
but I'm afraid there's little we can do to turn the tide.

786
46:50.940 --> 46:53.590
This battle will determine our very survival.

787
46:54.170 --> 46:55.970
We have nowhere left to retreat!

788
46:58.630 --> 46:59.560
Issue my orders!

789
47:01.400 --> 47:03.820
All defensive positions are to hold the line,

790
47:03.820 --> 47:06.020
wear down the enemy's fighting spirit,

791
47:06.090 --> 47:07.820
and strain their supply lines.

792
47:07.860 --> 47:09.730
They want a quick, decisive victory,

793
47:09.730 --> 47:12.390
so we'll keep them at bay with flexible tactics.

794
47:12.710 --> 47:13.940
Tell every soldier

795
47:14.300 --> 47:15.500
that I, Yu Changxuan,

796
47:15.780 --> 47:17.920
will stand with them on the front lines!

797
47:17.920 --> 47:18.580
-Yes! -Yes!

798
47:28.930 --> 47:33.440
[Forge Elite Troops]

799
47:32.480 --> 47:33.230
Changxuan.

800
47:37.820 --> 47:39.490
You haven't slept for days.

801
47:39.820 --> 47:40.950
You can't keep pushing yourself like this.

802
47:40.950 --> 47:42.010
I'll get the medic.

803
47:42.570 --> 47:43.170
Come back.

804
47:45.300 --> 47:48.030
We can't afford to undermine the troops' morale.

805
47:49.070 --> 47:49.980
I'm fine.
